.TH SAVE 10 "October 2026" "1.1" "Neverdark Manual"
.SH NAME
save \- Persist the world
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B save
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Write the world to disk: the map is synced first and the store is saved
after, so a crash between the two cannot leave a saved store pointing at an
unsaved map.
.PP
Only the root player may save. Anyone else is told that only root can.
Ordinary play persists nothing on its own; a daemon that is never told to
save loses everything since the last one.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR status (10)
.SH AUTHOR
quirinpa <quirinpa@tty.pt>
